title Execute One Skill Command - Target
actor Caller
participant "Skill command" as Skill
participant "Message admission" as Admission
database "Session context" as DB
participant "Agent execution" as Runtime
Caller -> Skill : Submit selected Skill and arguments
Skill -> Skill : Resolve trusted binding and freeze expansion
Skill -> Admission : Original input and private expansion snapshot
Admission -> DB : Recheck access, binding, idle and capacity\nCommit receipt and private context atomically
DB --> Admission : Fixed accepted root
Admission --> Caller : Original public user receipt first
Admission -> Runtime : Start with in-memory credentials
Runtime -> DB : Persist complete output and lifecycle boundary
Runtime -->> Caller : Best-effort preview and committed output
Caller -> Admission : Read history after disconnect
Admission -> DB : Query authorized public history
DB --> Admission : Complete public events
Admission --> Caller : Reconciled history without private Skill body
note over Skill,Admission
  Prepared snapshots do not bypass mutable admission checks.
  No separate Skill engine or automatic side-effect replay.
end note
